// # Const if (1==1 && 2==2) println no else
//
// Logline: Print peqand-ne when (1==1 && 2==2) and there is no else branch.
//
// Setup: No imports. One public main.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare public main.
//   2. If (1==1 && 2==2) print peqand-ne.
